Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 12:57:14 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1174/1198] HERESY 1167: the cheat-sheet up to 1800 px, its
 texts 2 pt larger, its head in parts: the warning in a line, a legend of
 four, how the probes were made folded
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor, 06.10.2026: «Дизайн аудио шпаргалки пересмотри. Там в голове навалено сплошными потоками. Увеличь тексты в ней на
2pt, и растяни на макс 1800px». The two paragraphs at its head (the warning and a stream of how the probes were made, what
a click does, the marks, the seeds, the pictures) became:
· the warning in one line, its first sentence bold;
· a legend of four: a click on a name, ▶ A · ▶ B, ✓ and red, the pictures (painted by an image model);
· How the probes were made, folded.
The table 13 → 15.5 px, its home, Russian line, verdicts and history in step; the sheet 1100 → 1800 px wide.

cdp-console 344/0/7, check-i18n 14/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css               | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/console/heresy-instruments.js | 20 +++++++++++++-------
 2 files changed, 37 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index 87dfb58..84ecbec 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -4084,3 +4084,27 @@ select option, select optgroup { background-color: var(--panel); color: var(--in
 :root[data-tone="light"] .coll-card:hover,
 :root[data-tone="light"] .coll-card.is-current { background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #ebe3e6, rgb(235 227 230 / 0)), var(--panel); }
 :root[data-tone="light"] .coll-card.is-sel { background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #e5d9dd, rgb(229 217 221 / 0)), var(--panel); }
+/* HERESY 1167 (Viktor: «Дизайн аудио шпаргалки пересмотри… Увеличь тексты в ней на 2pt, и растяни на макс 1800px»): the sheet up
+   to 1800 px; every text 2 pt larger; the head a warning line, a legend of four, the rest folded */
+.hi-box { width: min(1800px, 100%); gap: 10px; padding: 16px 20px; }
+.hi-head b { font-size: 19px; }
+#hiCount { font-size: 14.5px; }
+.hi-tabb { font-size: 15px; }
+.hi-warn { font-size: 15.5px; padding: 8px 12px; line-height: 1.45; }
+.hi-legend { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px 12px; }
+.hi-legend li { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: var(--r-md);
+  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--sunk) 70%, transparent); }
+.hi-legend b { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
+.hi-legend span { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--muted); }
+.hi-legend .hi-lg-ok { color: var(--good); }
+.hi-legend .hi-lg-no { color: var(--bad); font-style: normal; font-weight: 600; }
+.hi-more { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--muted); }
+.hi-more summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--ink); width: max-content; }
+.hi-more p { margin: 6px 0 2px; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 150ch; }
+.hi-tools input, .hi-tools select, .hi-tools label { font-size: 15px; }
+.hi-table { font-size: 15.5px; }
+.hi-home { font-size: 14px; }
+.hi-ru { font-size: 14.5px; }
+.hi-st { font-size: 13px; }
+.hi-his { font-size: 14.5px; }
+@media (max-width: 1000px) { .hi-legend { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
diff --git a/tools/console/heresy-instruments.js b/tools/console/heresy-instruments.js
index dc4605f..06cd77a 100644
--- a/tools/console/heresy-instruments.js
+++ b/tools/console/heresy-instruments.js
@@ -239,15 +239,21 @@
       '<div class="hi-head"><b>♪</b><span class="hi-tabs"><button type="button" class="hi-tabb" data-hi-tab="instruments">Instruments</button>' +
       '<button type="button" class="hi-tabb" data-hi-tab="styles">Styles</button></span><span class="row-hint" id="hiCount"></span><span class="spacer"></span>' +
       '<button type="button" class="btn ghost small" id="hiClose">Close</button></div>' +
